#: ../../districts/hongkou.rst:1
msgid "Hongkou"
msgstr "虹口区"

#: ../../districts/hongkou.rst:4
msgid "Shipping technology, green finance and intelligent inspection"
msgstr "航运科技、绿色金融与智能检测"

#: ../../districts/hongkou.rst:6
msgid ""
"The 2025-2026 Hongkou Park plan assigns a coordinated incubation and "
"investment role to the district state-owned Beikechuang group. Ask for "
"the operating carrier and current application notice, rather than relying "
"on older subsidy summaries."
msgstr "2025至2026年虹口园方案明确北科创集团在载体统筹、孵化与投融资方面的职责。应索取具体运营载体与现行申报通知，避免依赖旧版补贴概述。"

#: ../../districts/hongkou.rst:8
msgid ""
"`Evidence S026 "
"<https://www.shanghai.gov.cn/tszczq-cxcyqj7/20251119/b3f4914652a443c89bd1d1bd1320021d.html>`_. "
"虹口区人民政府关于印发 《张江高新区虹口园改革创新发展行动方案（2025—2026年）》的通知."
msgstr "`资料来源 S026 <https://www.shanghai.gov.cn/tszczq-cxcyqj7/20251119/b3f4914652a443c89bd1d1bd1320021d.html>`_. 虹口区人民政府关于印发 《张江高新区虹口园改革创新发展行动方案（2025—2026年）》的通知."

#: ../../districts/hongkou.rst:10
msgid "Who receives the inquiry"
msgstr "联系哪个部门"

#: ../../districts/hongkou.rst:13
msgid "Hongkou science and economy authority"
msgstr "虹口区科技和经济委员会"

#: ../../districts/hongkou.rst:15
msgid "`Official district website <https://www.shhk.gov.cn/>`_"
msgstr "`区政府官网 <https://www.shhk.gov.cn/>`_"

#: ../../districts/hongkou.rst:17
msgid ""
"Use the official website to request the responsible team and current "
"application route. Email addresses are not reproduced in this publication."
msgstr "请通过官网咨询具体负责部门及最新申请方式。本图谱不公开电子邮箱地址。"

#: ../../districts/hongkou.rst:19
msgid "Before applying"
msgstr "申请前需确认"

#: ../../districts/hongkou.rst:22
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "以下步骤为本书整理的申请参考，实际办理流程以最新官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../districts/hongkou.rst:24
msgid ""
"Read the dated call and verify district, entity, activity and "
"spending-period rules."
msgstr "阅读有明确发布日期的通知，确认属地、申请主体、业务及费用发生期间等条件。"

#: ../../districts/hongkou.rst:26
msgid ""
"Prepare the prescribed pack and complete host or district endorsement if "
"required."
msgstr "按清单准备材料，并按要求取得依托单位或区级部门推荐。"

#: ../../districts/hongkou.rst:28
msgid ""
"Submit through the official platform before the stated deadline and keep "
"the receipt."
msgstr "在截止时间前通过官方平台提交，保存受理回执。"

#: ../../districts/hongkou.rst:30
msgid ""
"Follow review, award, reporting, acceptance and payment obligations in "
"the notice."
msgstr "按通知要求完成评审、立项、报告、验收及资金拨付手续。"

#: ../../districts/hongkou.rst:32
msgid ""
"Ask which current notice governs the project, whether registration and "
"actual operations must both be in the district, which expenditure period "
"is eligible, and whether previous municipal or district awards exclude a "
"claim. Obtain the answer before moving a company or incurring costs."
msgstr "申请前应确认适用的最新通知，企业注册地和实际经营地是否都须在本区，哪些期间的费用可以申报，以及已获市级或区级资助是否影响本次申请。企业迁址或发生支出前，应先取得明确答复。"

#: ../../districts/hongkou.rst:34
msgid "Local organizations in this atlas"
msgstr "本区收录机构"

#: ../../districts/hongkou.rst:37
msgid ""
":doc:`Zhangjiang Hongkou Park / Beikechuang </entities/hongkou-park>` "
"(张江虹口园／北科创 · Technology park · Software AI, Industry) — The park plan "
"gives Beikechuang a coordinating role in incubation, technology transfer "
"and investment services. Request the relevant sub-park and named "
"operating company for a project-specific response. [Status: Published "
"entity; intake to confirm]"
msgstr ":doc:`张江虹口园／北科创 </entities/hongkou-park>` （科技园区 · AI软件、产业）： 园区方案明确由北科创统筹孵化、技术转移及投融资服务。咨询时应明确具体子园区和运营公司，便于获得与项目相关的答复。【状态：机构信息已核实，当前是否接受申请需确认】"

#: ../../districts/hongkou.rst:38
msgid ""
":doc:`Hongkou Science & Technology Entrepreneurship Center "
"</entities/hongkou-stec>` (虹口区科技创业中心与博士后创新基地 · Incubator · Software AI, "
"Industry, Climate) — District public entrepreneurship center and "
"postdoctoral innovation practice base route supporting tech SMEs, "
"green-shipping digital tools and R&D talent settlement in Hongkou. "
"[Status: Published entity; intake to confirm]"
msgstr ":doc:`虹口区科技创业中心与博士后创新基地 </entities/hongkou-stec>` （孵化器 · AI软件、产业、气候）： 虹口公共科技创业中心及博士后创新实践基地相关服务，可供科技型中小企业、绿色航运数字化团队及研发人才咨询。【状态：机构信息已核实，当前是否接受申请需确认】"

#: ../../districts/hongkou.rst:39
msgid ""
":doc:`Shanghai International Studies University "
"</entities/university-sisu>` (上海外国语大学 · University) — Institutional entry "
"in the June 2026 Ministry of Education register. Suggested collaboration "
"themes: Language technology, translation, international markets. These "
"themes are editorial routing guidance, not a verified offer of laboratory "
"access or startup funding. [Status: Published entity; intake to confirm]"
msgstr ":doc:`上海外国语大学 </entities/university-sisu>` （高校）： 该校列入教育部2026年6月公布的高校名录。可关注的合作方向包括：语言技术、翻译、国际市场。这些方向仅供寻找合作方时参考，不代表已确认可使用相关实验室或获得创业资助。【状态：机构信息已核实，当前是否接受申请需确认】"

#: ../../districts/hongkou.rst:40
msgid ""
":doc:`Xianda College of Economics and Humanities, SISU "
"</entities/university-xianda>` (上海外国语大学贤达经济人文学院 · University) — "
"Institutional entry in the June 2026 Ministry of Education register. "
"Suggested collaboration themes: Language, commerce and creative "
"applications. These themes are editorial routing guidance, not a verified "
"offer of laboratory access or startup funding. [Status: Published entity; "
"intake to confirm]"
msgstr ":doc:`上海外国语大学贤达经济人文学院 </entities/university-xianda>` （高校）： 该校列入教育部2026年6月公布的高校名录。可关注的合作方向包括：语言、商业与创意应用。这些方向仅供寻找合作方时参考，不代表已确认可使用相关实验室或获得创业资助。【状态：机构信息已核实，当前是否接受申请需确认】"

#: ../../districts/hongkou.rst:42
msgid "Funding routes"
msgstr "融资与扶持渠道"

#: ../../districts/hongkou.rst:45
msgid ""
":doc:`Hongkou international and overseas young talent support, first 2026 "
"batch </funding/hongkou-talent-2026>` (2026虹口国际顶尖及海外优秀青年人才扶持第一批 · Grant · "
"No equity) — Recognized top talent and core team: up to RMB 1m; eligible "
"overseas young talent: RMB 50,000 per person. Status: Closed. Timing: "
"Closed 31 March 2026."
msgstr ":doc:`2026虹口国际顶尖及海外优秀青年人才扶持第一批 </funding/hongkou-talent-2026>` （补助 · 不占股）： 认定顶尖人才及核心团队最高100万元，符合条件的海外优秀青年人才每人5万元。状态：已截止。时间：已于2026年3月31日截止。"

#: ../../districts/hongkou.rst:47
msgid ":doc:`Also compare citywide funding </funding>`"
msgstr ":doc:`同时比较全市融资与扶持渠道 </funding>`"

